<section class="split-head"><div>{{label('Profile')}}<h1>About Tejas</h1>
<p class="deck">I published my first collection of Kannada poems at thirteen. Since then, I have written fiction and essays, translated books into English, and interpreted Kannada poetry at Gamaka performances.</p>
<p>I was born in Bengaluru and educated in Chintamani and Mysuru. After completing my law degree at JSS Law College in Mysuru, I returned to Bengaluru for postgraduate study at RV University.</p><a class="text-link" href="@root/law/">My legal education</a></div>
