</section><aside class="side-note"><h2>Languages</h2><p>Kannada, English, Telugu and Hindi.</p><h2>Mentors</h2><p>Vidwan Dr R S Nandakumar has guided my work in literature, music and technology. From Vidushi Shubha Raghavendra I learned Gamaka, a tradition in which a singer renders a poem and a commentator interprets it for listeners.</p><h2>Research and editorial skills</h2><p>My work includes case-law research, teaching, debate and translation. I also prepare publications in Adobe InDesign and edit audio and video interviews.</p></aside></div></div>
